  "solution": "We apply each option on the given equation and solve it by using BODMAS rule:**\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/8a6f93b0f8305d496162d41f65450f13e20c650df2dbe481929271174df469e9.png] \n\nOption 1) + ÷ - ×\n\n20 + __**4 ÷ 10**__ - 5 × 15 = 93\n\n20 + 0.4 - __**5 × 15**__ = 93\n\n__**20 + 0.4**__ - 75 = 93\n\n__**20.4 - 75**__ = 93\n\n54.6 ≠ 93\n\nOption 2) ÷ × + -\n\n__**20 ÷ 4**__ × 10 + 5 - 15 = 93\n\n__**5 **____**× 10**__ + 5 - 15 = 93\n\n__**50 + 5**__ - 15 = 93\n\n__**55 - 15**__ = 93\n\n40 ≠ 93\n\nOption 3) - × ÷ +\n\n20 - 4 × __**10 ÷ 5**__ + 15 = 93\n\n20 - __**4 × **____2__** + 15 = 93\n\n__**20**__ - 8 __**+ 15**__ = 93\n\n__**35 - 8**__ = 93\n\n27 ≠ 93\n\nOption 4) × - ÷ +\n\n20 × 4 - __**10 ÷ 5**__ + 15 = 93\n\n__**20 **____**×**____** 4**__ - 2 + 15 = 93\n\n__**80**__ - 2 __**+**____** 15**__ = 93\n\n**__95 - 2__** =93\n\n93 = 93 \n\nHence **the correct answer is option 4)**",
